<title>USA: TABLE-American Real Estate Q2 unit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-American Real Estate Q2 unit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT KISCO, N.Y. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Unit			 $0.57		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net			 15,935		   12,405</p>
<p> Revs			15,523		   16,976</p>
<p> Avg units		 27,573		   27,997</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Unit			 $2.01		    $0.82</p>
<p> Net			 56,723		   23,406</p>
<p> Revs			32,822		   37,567</p>
<p> Avg units		 27,722		   27,972</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except unit numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The 1997 Q2 net includes a gain on the sale of real estate of $8 million not included in revenues. The 1996 Q2 includes a similar gain of $5.5 million.</p>
<p>The 1997 first half includes a gain on the sale of real estate of $10.9 million and a gain of $29.2 million on the sale of securities, neither of which is included in revenues.</p>
<p>The 1996 first half includes a gain of $5.5 million on the sale of real estate, which is not included in revenues.</p>
<p>Full name of company is American Real Estate Partners LP</p>
